  "releaseNotes": "Adopts the scoped device identity addition to the Moonbase fingerprint spec. Still moonbase:fingerprint:v2 and fully additive, so no existing binding breaks. Device ids can now carry the app-scoped 's' tag (mbd2s_), the parser accepts a tag a newer SDK introduced, and iOS is a recognised platform. Note that DeviceIdStamp.Source is now nullable and the host-name fallback throws on iOS and Android. See CHANGELOG.md.",
